  "premise": "Told by Happie, an Akita, this short drama follows a working-class man whose wife asks for a divorce. Jobless and nearly penniless, he drives south with the dog, helps a hungry boy who later steals his wallet, pawns his belongings for the dog's surgery, and dies in his car at a campground; Happie stays loyally by him until his own death. A second story follows from their discovery (Wikipedia; MangaUpdates; AniList).",
